{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"resendOwnVerification()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC21resendOwnVerificationyyYaKF"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes no address. The server reads it off the caller’s own record, and this signature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberately offers no way to name a different one: a parameter here would let an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticated session mail an arbitrary address."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},{"type":"text","text":" this reports the outcome, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller is signed in to the account it is asking about and none of the outcomes tells"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it anything it did not already bring with it:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"returns — a token was minted and the mail ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"enqueued","type":"text"}]},{"text":". Delivery is asynchronous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and can still fail at the provider; a queue that accepts everything in front of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider that rejects it looks exactly like this succeeding (§25.7 rule 3).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.authz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"409","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — already verified, or an account state that must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be sent a live token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.network","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — the daily resend limit.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"§25.7 rule 2 forbids falling back to the unauthenticated endpoint on either failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and this SDK does not: that fallback turns both back into a silent success and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restores the bug this operation exists to fix, with an extra round trip.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Refused client-side with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"no wire call","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" when there is no session.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"signed-in caller’s own","type":"text"}]},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendOwnVerification()":{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"signed-in caller’s own","type":"text"}]},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()","role":"symbol","title":"resendOwnVerification()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"AxiamSDK","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"unauthenticated","type":"text"}]},{"text":" resend, for a caller with no session.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendverification(email:tenantid:)","role":"symbol","title":"resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamClient","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md)."}]}}}